# ABP UI Frameworks

## Supported UI Frameworks
- **Blazor** (Server & WebAssembly)
- **Angular**
- **MVC / Razor Pages**
- **MAUI** (Mobile)
- **React Native** (Mobile)

## Common Features Across UIs
- Localization integration
- Authorization (permission checking)
- Theming support
- Dynamic menu system
- Modal dialogs
- Form validation
- Notification system

## Theming
- Basic Theme (included)
- LeptonX Theme (commercial)
- Custom themes via CSS variables

## JavaScript Interop (Blazor/MVC)
ABP provides JavaScript APIs for:
- Localization
- Authorization
- Settings
- Features
- Current user
